{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-sliced-design","title":"Feature Sliced Design 方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/application-structure/feature-sliced-design","wordCount":970,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"feature-sliced-design-方法论\">Feature Sliced Design 方法论</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Feature Sliced Design (FSD) 是一套标准化的前端架构方法论，通过分层（Layers）和切片（Slices）两个维度组织代码。与随意的 components/pages/utils 目录结构不同，FSD 提供了严格的导入规则和职责边界，从架构层面消除循环依赖、降低耦合度。2026 年，FSD 已从俄罗斯前端社区走向全球，配套的 Steiger 静态分析工具可以在 CI 中自动检测架构违规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"七层架构\">七层架构</h3><p>FSD 将代码组织为 7 个标准化层，从高到低排列：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;FSD Layers - Top to Bottom&quot;&#10;        L1[&quot;app - Global init, providers, routing config&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;processes - Deprecated, moved to features/app&quot;]&#10;        L3[&quot;pages - Page-level business logic&quot;]&#10;        L4[&quot;widgets - Composite UI blocks spanning features&quot;]&#10;        L5[&quot;features - User interactions with business value&quot;]&#10;        L6[&quot;entities - Business domain objects&quot;]&#10;        L7[&quot;shared - Reusable utilities, UI kit, configs&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    L1 --&gt; L3&#10;    L3 --&gt; L4&#10;    L4 --&gt; L5&#10;    L5 --&gt; L6&#10;    L6 --&gt; L7\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"FSD Layers - Top to Bottom\"\n        L1[\"app - Global init, providers, routing config\"]\n        L2[\"processes - Deprecated, moved to features/app\"]\n        L3[\"pages - Page-level business logic\"]\n        L4[\"widgets - Composite UI blocks spanning features\"]\n        L5[\"features - User interactions with business value\"]\n        L6[\"entities - Business domain objects\"]\n        L7[\"shared - Reusable utilities, UI kit, configs\"]\n    end\n    L1 --&gt; L3\n    L3 --&gt; L4\n    L4 --&gt; L5\n    L5 --&gt; L6\n    L6 --&gt; L7</pre><p><strong>核心导入规则</strong>：一个模块只能导入其正下方层级的模块。<code>features</code> 可以导入 <code>entities</code> 和 <code>shared</code>，但不能导入 <code>widgets</code> 或 <code>pages</code>。同层级的切片之间互相不可导入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"层级详解\">层级详解</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>app</code></td>\n<td>应用初始化、全局 Provider、路由配置</td>\n<td><code>app/providers.tsx</code>, <code>app/routes.tsx</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pages</code></td>\n<td>页面级业务逻辑组合</td>\n<td><code>pages/article-read</code>, <code>pages/settings</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>widgets</code></td>\n<td>跨 feature 的大型 UI 组合块</td>\n<td><code>widgets/article-card</code>, <code>widgets/sidebar</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>features</code></td>\n<td>用户交互功能（有业务价值）</td>\n<td><code>features/auth</code>, <code>features/add-to-cart</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>entities</code></td>\n<td>业务域对象和数据模型</td>\n<td><code>entities/user</code>, <code>entities/article</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shared</code></td>\n<td>可复用工具、UI 组件、配置</td>\n<td><code>shared/ui</code>, <code>shared/api</code>, <code>shared/lib</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"slice-与-segment\">Slice 与 Segment</h3><p>每一层内部由多个 <strong>Slice</strong>（切片）组成，每个 Slice 代表一个独立的业务概念。每个 Slice 内部通过 <strong>Segment</strong>（段）划分技术关注点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"src/features/add-to-cart/&#10;├── ui/          → React 组件&#10;│   ├── AddToCartButton.tsx&#10;│   └── CartQuantityInput.tsx&#10;├── model/       → 业务逻辑和状态&#10;│   ├── store.ts&#10;│   └── types.ts&#10;├── api/         → 数据请求&#10;│   └── addToCart.ts&#10;├── lib/         → 工具函数&#10;│   └── validateQuantity.ts&#10;└── index.ts     → Public API (唯一出口)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>src/features/add-to-cart/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── ui/          → React 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── AddToCartButton.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── CartQuantityInput.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── model/       → 业务逻辑和状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── store.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── types.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── api/         → 数据请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── addToCart.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── lib/         → 工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── validateQuantity.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── index.ts     → Public API (唯一出口)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Public API 原则</strong>：外部只能通过 Slice 根目录的 <code>index.ts</code> 访问内容。任何内部模块的直接导入都是架构违规。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ✅ 正确：通过 Public API 导入&#10;import { AddToCartButton } from &#39;@/features/add-to-cart&#39;;&#10;&#10;// ❌ 错误：直接访问内部模块&#10;import { AddToCartButton } from &#39;@/features/add-to-cart/ui/AddToCartButton&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 正确：通过 Public API 导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { AddToCartButton } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/features/add-to-cart'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 错误：直接访问内部模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { AddToCartButton } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/features/add-to-cart/ui/AddToCartButton'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"完整项目结构示例\">完整项目结构示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"src/&#10;├── app/&#10;│   ├── providers.tsx       # React Query, Theme, Auth providers&#10;│   ├── router.tsx          # Route definitions&#10;│   └── global.css&#10;├── pages/&#10;│   ├── home/&#10;│   │   ├── ui/HomePage.tsx&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   ├── article-read/&#10;│   │   ├── ui/ArticlePage.tsx&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   └── settings/&#10;│       ├── ui/SettingsPage.tsx&#10;│       └── index.ts&#10;├── widgets/&#10;│   ├── article-card/&#10;│   │   ├── ui/ArticleCard.tsx&#10;│   │   ├── model/useArticleActions.ts&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   └── header/&#10;│       ├── ui/Header.tsx&#10;│       └── index.ts&#10;├── features/&#10;│   ├── auth/&#10;│   │   ├── ui/LoginForm.tsx&#10;│   │   ├── model/authStore.ts&#10;│   │   ├── api/login.ts&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   ├── add-to-cart/&#10;│   │   ├── ui/AddToCartButton.tsx&#10;│   │   ├── model/cartStore.ts&#10;│   │   ├── api/addToCart.ts&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   └── article-comments/&#10;│       ├── ui/CommentForm.tsx&#10;│       ├── model/commentsStore.ts&#10;│       └── index.ts&#10;├── entities/&#10;│   ├── user/&#10;│   │   ├── ui/UserAvatar.tsx&#10;│   │   ├── model/types.ts&#10;│   │   ├── api/getUser.ts&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   ├── article/&#10;│   │   ├── ui/ArticlePreview.tsx&#10;│   │   ├── model/types.ts&#10;│   │   ├── api/getArticles.ts&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   └── product/&#10;│       ├── ui/ProductTile.tsx&#10;│       ├── model/types.ts&#10;│       └── index.ts&#10;└── shared/&#10;    ├── ui/&#10;    │   ├── Button.tsx&#10;    │   ├── Input.tsx&#10;    │   ├── Modal.tsx&#10;    │   └── index.ts&#10;    ├── api/&#10;    │   ├── client.ts        # axios/fetch 封装&#10;    │   └── index.ts&#10;    ├── lib/&#10;    │   ├── formatDate.ts&#10;    │   ├── cn.ts            # className 工具&#10;    │   └── index.ts&#10;    └── config/&#10;        ├── env.ts&#10;        └── index.ts\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── providers.tsx       # React Query, Theme, Auth providers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── router.tsx          # Route definitions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── global.css</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── pages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── home/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── ui/HomePage.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── article-read/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── ui/ArticlePage.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── settings/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── ui/SettingsPage.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── widgets/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── article-card/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── ui/ArticleCard.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── model/useArticleActions.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── header/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── ui/Header.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── features/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── auth/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── ui/LoginForm.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── model/authStore.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── api/login.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── add-to-cart/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── ui/AddToCartButton.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── model/cartStore.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── api/addToCart.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── article-comments/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── ui/CommentForm.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── model/commentsStore.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── entities/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── user/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── ui/UserAvatar.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── model/types.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── api/getUser.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── article/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── ui/ArticlePreview.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── model/types.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── api/getArticles.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── product/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── ui/ProductTile.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── model/types.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── shared/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── ui/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── Button.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── Input.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── Modal.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── api/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── client.ts        # axios/fetch 封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── lib/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── formatDate.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── cn.ts            # className 工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── config/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├── env.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── index.ts</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"与-next-js-app-router-集成\">与 Next.js App Router 集成</h3><p>FSD 与 Next.js App Router 的关键整合点在于路由目录(<code>/app</code>) 与业务逻辑(<code>/src</code>) 的分离：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/ 目录只负责路由，不包含业务逻辑&#10;// app/articles/[id]/page.tsx&#10;import { ArticlePage } from &#39;@/pages/article-read&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function Page({ params }: { params: { id: string } }) {&#10;  return &lt;ArticlePage articleId={params.id} /&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// src/pages/article-read/ui/ArticlePage.tsx&#10;import { ArticleCard } from &#39;@/widgets/article-card&#39;;&#10;import { CommentSection } from &#39;@/features/article-comments&#39;;&#10;import { getArticle } from &#39;@/entities/article&#39;;&#10;&#10;export async function ArticlePage({ articleId }: { articleId: string }) {&#10;  const article = await getArticle(articleId);&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;main&gt;&#10;      &lt;ArticleCard article={article} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;CommentSection articleId={articleId} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/main&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/ 目录只负责路由，不包含业务逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/articles/[id]/page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ArticlePage } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/pages/article-read'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A4