code>entities</code> 层</strong>：识别核心业务模型，将其数据获取和类型定义归类</li>\n<li><strong>建立 <code>features</code> 层</strong>：将用户交互逻辑从页面组件中抽离</li>\n<li><strong>最后处理 <code>pages</code> 和 <code>widgets</code></strong>：将页面组件中的直接导入替换为层级间的正确导入</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"steiger-静态检查配置\">Steiger 静态检查配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// steiger.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;@feature-sliced/steiger&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  rules: {&#10;    &#39;no-cross-slice-imports&#39;: &#39;error&#39;, // 禁止同层切片间导入&#10;    &#39;no-public-api-bypass&#39;: &#39;error&#39;, // 禁止绕过 index.ts&#10;    &#39;no-layer-violation&#39;: &#39;error&#39;, // 禁止向上层导入&#10;    &#39;no-deprecated-layers&#39;: &#39;warn&#39;, // 警告使用 processes 层&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// steiger.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@feature-sliced/steiger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no-cross-slice-imports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 禁止同层切片间导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no-public-api-bypass'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 禁止绕过 index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no-layer-violation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 禁止向上层导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no-deprecated-layers'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 警告使用 processes 层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CI 集成&#10;npx steiger src/&#10;# 或在 lint-staged 中&#10;npx steiger --changed\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 集成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> steiger</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或在 lint-staged 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> steiger</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --changed</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/feature-sliced/steiger\">Steiger</a></td>\n<td>架构 Lint</td>\n<td>FSD 官方，CI 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/feature-sliced/eslint-config\">@feature-sliced/eslint-config</a></td>\n<td>ESLint 规则</td>\n<td>import 规则强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fsd-cli</td>\n<td>脚手架生成</td>\n<td>自动创建 slice 目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VS Code FSD Snippets</td>\n<td>代码片段</td>\n<td>快速生成 slice 结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dependency Cruiser</td>\n<td>可视化依赖图</td>\n<td>发现隐藏的架构违规</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"fsd-与其他方法论对比\">FSD 与其他方法论对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>FSD</th>\n<th>Clean Architecture</th>\n<th>Atomic Design</th>\n<th>按类型分组</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组织维度</td>\n<td>层 + 业务切片</td>\n<td>依赖方向 (外→内)</td>\n<td>UI 粒度</td>\n<td>技术类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制规则</td>\n<td>导入方向 + Public API</td>\n<td>依赖反转</td>\n<td>无强制</td>\n<td>无强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具支持</td>\n<td>Steiger (lint)</td>\n<td>手动遵守</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大型项目扩展性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队协作</td>\n<td>并行开发友好</td>\n<td>需要强规范</td>\n<td>容易冲突</td>\n<td>容易冲突</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>FSD 的核心价值在于用规则替代约定——通过严格的层级导入规则和 Public API 边界，从架构层面防止&quot;代码腐烂&quot;。它特别适合 3 人以上团队维护的中大型项目，能显著降低新成员上手成本和跨功能修改的风险。结合 Steiger 等自动化工具，FSD 的架构约束可以在 CI 中持续验证，确保项目随时间推移保持结构清晰。选择 FSD 的关键前提是团队愿意投入学习成本——理解 entity 和 feature 的边界、掌握 Public API 的设计——这个前期投入将在项目中后期获得数倍的维护效率回报。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Feature Sliced Design 方法论","id":"feature-sliced-design-方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"七层架构","id":"七层架构"},{"level":3,"text":"层级详解","id":"层级详解"},{"level":3,"text":"Slice 与 Segment","id":"slice-与-segment"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"完整项目结构示例","id":"完整项目结构示例"},{"level":3,"text":"与 Next.js App Router 集成","id":"与-next-js-app-router-集成"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript 路径别名配置","id":"typescript-路径别名配置"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"Feature vs Entity 的区分","id":"feature-vs-entity-的区分"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进式迁移策略","id":"渐进式迁移策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Steiger 静态检查配置","id":"steiger-静态检查配置"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"FSD 与其他方法论对比","id":"fsd-与其他方法论对比"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"React Server Components 架构原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/rendering-architecture/react-server-components"},"next":{"title":"Clean Architecture 前端实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/application-structure/clean-architecture-frontend"}}